# Earth Symphony frontend environment
#
# Leave VITE_TEMPERATURE_DATA_URL empty (or omit the file) to use the clearly
# labelled mock dataset.
#
# Data URL options:
#   1. VITE_TEMPERATURE_DATA_URL=/data/temperature.json
#      VITE_TEMPERATURE_DATA_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/phenomena/global-temperature-anomaly/series
#
#   2. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL to the Spring Boot backend URL and the service
#      will call the backend /api/v1/phenomena/{id}/series endpoint:
#        VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
#
VITE_TEMPERATURE_DATA_URL=
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080